 Better initialize beatIndex = Math.floor(state.sweep/q) at lead end? At start set -1, then loop while state.beatIndex < idx: beatIndex++, playTick(beatIndex%4===0). If idx could be 0 and beatIndex -1 => increments 0 → tick. Fine.
